Data
----
- NASA FIRMS MODIS active fire detections (Terra/Aqua), yearly country files.
  NASA's Fire Information for Resource Management System (FIRMS),
  part of NASA's Earth Science Data and Information System (ESDIS).
  https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/
- NASA FIRMS VIIRS S-NPP 375 m active fire detections, yearly country files.
- NASA FIRMS VIIRS NOAA-20 375 m active fire detections, yearly country files.
- Province boundaries: Georef, Argentine government, CC BY 4.0.
  https://apis.datos.gob.ar/georef/
- Optional map layer: SAOCOM L-band radar mosaics, 2022, CONAE
  (Comisión Nacional de Actividades Espaciales, Argentina), served by
  CONAE's open WMS. https://geoportal.conae.gov.ar/
- Basemap tiles: OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL.

